  "description": "At Pinky Pop, an innovative adult toy company, the corporate culture is anything but ordinary. Every month, a \"New Product Tester\" is chosen by lottery to wear the company’s latest invention for a full week at the office. The prize for keeping it a secret? A fat bonus and paid vacation. When the chronically unlucky Nari draws the winning ticket, she thinks she can handle the heat. But when sharp-eyed Manager Seo catches onto her suspicious behavior, he offers a deal: he’ll keep her secret, provided she gives him a very private demonstration.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
